      "title": "Number, duration and offering-unit limits",
      "kind": "note",
      "count": null,
      "credits": null,
      "credit_unit": "unknown",
      "category": "other",
      "source_id": "columbia-ai-minor-college-policies",
      "source_text": null,
      "summary": "At most three programs, no more than two majors or two minors, and at least one major. No additional semesters are granted for another program beyond eight total semesters, including prior transfer terms; additional programs must fit the expected workload without regular petitions above 18 points. Programs cannot share an offering unit, and joint majors belong to both units.",
